---
const title = "Privacy Policy";
const description = "Read how PromptVibe HQ handles information, cookies, and advertising technologies.";
const lastUpdated = "October 18, 2026";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>{title} | PromptVibe HQ</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta name="robots" content="index,follow" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.promptvibehq.com/privacy" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,400;0,6..72,500;1,6..72,400&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
      *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
      body{background:#0e0e0e;color:#e0e0e0;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column}
      .container{max-width:900px;width:100%;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
      header{border-bottom:1px solid #262626;background:rgba(14,14,14,.94);height:80px;display:flex;align-items:center}
      .header-content{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:24px}
      .logo{font-family:'Newsreader',serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap}
      .dot{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;margin-right:8px}
      nav{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}
      nav a,footer a{color:#a3a3a3;text-decoration:none;font-size:13px}
      nav a:hover,footer a:hover{color:#fff}
      main{flex:1;padding-top:52px;padding-bottom:48px}
      .eyebrow{color:#22c55e;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;margin-bottom:14px}
      h1,h2{font-family:'Newsreader',serif;color:#fff}
      h1{font-size:clamp(36px,6vw,48px);line-height:1.12;margin-bottom:16px}
      h2{font-size:24px;margin:30px 0 12px}
      .updated{font-size:13px;color:#888;margin-bottom:28px}
      .intro{font-size:16px;line-height:1.85;color:#bdbdbd;margin-bottom:20px}
      .content{background:#151515;border:1px solid #292929;border-radius:16px;padding:32px}
      p,li{font-size:14px;line-height:1.9;color:#bdbdbd}
      p+p{margin-top:12px}
      ul{padding-left:22px;margin:12px 0}
      li+li{margin-top:7px}
      a.inline{color:#22c55e;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
      footer{border-top:1px solid #262626;padding:30px 0;text-align:center;color:#737373;font-size:12px}
      .footer-links{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:14px}
      @media(max-width:640px){header{height:auto;padding:20px 0}.header-content{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}nav{gap:14px}main{padding-top:36px}.content{padding:22px}}
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <div class="container header-content">
        <a href="/" class="logo"><span class="dot"></span>PromptVibe <span style="font-style:italic;font-weight:400;color:#a3a3a3">HQ</span></a>
        <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href="/">Home</a><a href="/prompts">All Prompts</a><a href="/about">About</a><a href="/privacy" aria-current="page">Privacy</a><a href="/contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>
    <main class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow">Privacy & transparency</div>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      <p class="intro">This Privacy Policy explains how PromptVibe HQ (“we,” “us,” or “our”) may collect, use, and disclose information when you visit https://www.promptvibehq.com. Please read it carefully. This policy should be kept aligned with the tools and services actually enabled on the website.</p>

      <article class="content">
        <h2>1. Information we may collect</h2>
        <p><strong>Information you send us:</strong> If you contact us by email, we receive the information included in your message, such as your email address, name if provided, and the contents of your request.</p>
        <p><strong>Technical information:</strong> When you visit a website, our hosting provider and security systems may process technical data such as your IP address, browser and device information, requested pages, timestamps, and error logs. The exact information retained depends on the hosting and security services in use.</p>
        <p><strong>Cookies and similar technologies:</strong> The website or third-party services may use cookies or similar technologies for essential functionality, security, analytics, or advertising, where those services are enabled.</p>

        <h2>2. How information may be used</h2>
        <p>Information may be used to operate and secure the website, respond to messages, diagnose technical problems, understand general site usage where analytics are enabled, comply with legal obligations, and support advertising services if they are enabled.</p>

        <h2>3. Advertising and third-party services</h2>
        <p>If Google AdSense or another advertising provider is enabled on this website, that provider and its partners may use cookies, web beacons, IP addresses, or similar technologies to serve, measure, limit, and personalize ads as permitted by applicable settings and law. Third-party vendors, including Google, may place and read cookies on visitors’ browsers or use web beacons to collect information as a result of ad serving on this website.</p>
        <p>Google’s explanation of how it uses information on partner sites is available at <a class="inline" href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">How Google uses information from sites or apps that use its services</a>. You can review Google’s privacy information at <a class="inline" href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
        <p>Advertising and analytics services are operated by their respective providers and are subject to their own policies. We do not control the data practices of third-party services. This section must be updated if the services used by the website change.</p>

        <h2>4. Cookies and advertising choices</h2>
        <p>You can control cookies through your browser settings, although disabling certain cookies may affect website functionality. Where required by applicable law, consent choices for non-essential cookies or personalized advertising should be presented before the relevant technologies are used. If advertising consent tools are enabled on this website, visitors can use them to review or change their choices.</p>
        <p>Depending on your location and the services enabled, you may also be able to manage advertising personalization through the settings provided by the relevant advertising provider.</p>

        <h2>5. Sharing and retention</h2>
        <p>We may share information with service providers that help host, secure, maintain, analyze, or monetize the website, where those services are actually used. Information may also be disclosed when required by law or when reasonably necessary to protect the website, its users, or our rights.</p>
        <p>We retain information for no longer than reasonably necessary for the purpose for which it was collected, subject to security, operational, and legal requirements. Retention periods can vary by provider and data type.</p>

        <h2>6. Data security</h2>
        <p>We use reasonable measures intended to protect information handled through the website. However, no internet transmission or storage method can be guaranteed to be completely secure.</p>

        <h2>7. Your privacy rights</h2>
        <p>Depending on your location and applicable law, you may have rights to request access to, correction of, or deletion of personal information, or to object to or restrict certain processing. To make a privacy-related request, contact us using the email address below. We may need to verify your request before responding.</p>

        <h2>8. Children’s privacy</h2>
        <p>This website is intended for a general audience and is not designed to knowingly collect personal information from children in violation of applicable law. If you believe a child has provided personal information to us, contact us so we can review the matter.</p>

        <h2>9. Links to other websites</h2>
        <p>Our pages may link to third-party websites or AI services. We are not responsible for the content, security, or privacy practices of those external services. Review their policies before providing information to them.</p>

        <h2>10. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy when our website, services, or legal obligations change. The “Last updated” date at the top indicates when this page was most recently revised. Continued use of the website after an update means you can view the revised policy; it does not replace any consent required by law.</p>

        <h2>11. Contact</h2>
        <p>For privacy questions or requests, email <a class="inline" href="mailto:support@promptvibehq.com">support@promptvibehq.com</a>.</p>
      </article>
    </main>
    <footer>
      <div class="container">
        <div class="footer-links"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/prompts">All Prompts</a><a href="/about">About</a><a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a><a href="/contact">Contact</a></div>
        <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} PromptVibe HQ. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
